- [ ] Remember that **Versioning** must be enabled for **CRR/SRR** and **Object Lock**[cite: 1].
- [ ] Differentiate **Glacier Instant** (ms access) vs **Glacier Flexible** (mins to hours) vs **Glacier Deep Archive** (12–48 hours).
- [ ] Distinguish **Global Accelerator** (Anycast IP, non-cached TCP/UDP optimization) from **CloudFront** (HTTP edge caching) and **S3 Transfer Acceleration** (S3 data upload optimization)[cite: 1].
- [ ] Identify **CloudFormation StackSets** as the primary solution for multi-region or multi-account boilerplate deployments.
- [ ] Remember that an S3 bucket configuration with a default `DeletionPolicy` will fail to delete via CloudFormation if the bucket contains objects.